The json-version merge driver registrations in .gitattributes name the driver that the tracked .githooks/merge-json-version script implements, and the per-clone git config registration documented in the hooks README resolves that name; the driver name and the %O %A %B %P argument contract must agree across all three, or plugin.json merges silently fall back to unresolved text conflicts.
